{
  "$comment": "silo.hllmr.com public URL contract. Every path the current site serves, that shipped binaries, gists, Discord posts, the DMCA filing or search engines may hold, plus the planned additions. A regression here fails CI. 'pending' names the plan task that makes an entry live; pending entries are reported as TODO and become hard failures under CONTRACT_STRICT=1 (the release workflow sets it). Statuses are what the deployed nginx (deploy/silo/nginx.conf) answers; 'location' is the exact Location header (relative, absolute_redirect off).",
  "site": "silo",
  "entries": [
    { "path": "/", "status": 200, "contains": "Less fixing.", "why": "home; canonical; JSON-LD url" },
    { "path": "/index.html", "status": 200, "contains": "Less fixing.", "why": "old nav.js treated it as home" },

    { "path": "/browse/", "status": 200, "pending": "P1-05", "why": "README, llms.txt, app copy, Discord bot" },
